Report format: a numbered list of CONCRETE findings. For each, give the C line number(s), the Rust file:line, what the C does, what the Rust does, and whether it is a real behavioural difference or benign. If a function is fully equivalent, say so in one line. Be exhaustive and precise; do not speculate without checking the actual source. End with a summary count of real behavioural differences found.","uuid":"8516e27b-a9f4-4290-8b52-3d260f31bc8e","session_id":"b0a431b9-dd3c-4caf-92f8-2cde17342eee"}
